-- Shadow Leviathan Quest automation. This system is entirely separate from regular
-- bounties: nothing is active until the player picks one of 3 randomly-generated
-- candidates with StartLeviathanQuest(index), regenerated from playerData.ShadowLeviathan
-- (Seed, and Next - the 1-hour cooldown timestamp) through the game's own quest-data
-- module. Once picked, the resulting quest has the same Tasks/Progress shape as any other
-- bounty, so its tasks run through the exact same BGSI_Lite_RunQuestTask dispatcher used
-- for Challenge Pass and daily bounties above.
activeStates.BGSI_Lite_GetShadowLeviathanQuestModule = function()
	if activeStates.BGSI_Lite_ShadowLeviathanQuestModule == nil then
		local ok, questFn = pcall(require, ReplicatedStorage.Shared.Data.Quests.ShadowLeviathanQuest)
